{"4325640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Corroded", "steam_appid": 4325640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corroded is a co-op horror survival game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're safe from the creatures and flooding lands inside the walls of your bunker but you need food and supplies to continue surviving. Do loot runs, get supplies, avoid drowning when the flood comes, build better gear, expand your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FLOODLANDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ever changing uniquely generating floodlands but be careful, you're not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you  explore, grab anything you can gather and return back before the water rises and you risk drowning. Items that don't seem useful could always be recycled and scrapped for raw materials so make sure to load up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/e021838d321465542b5c478ad63024f8.poster.avif?t=1788114871\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/e021838d321465542b5c478ad63024f8.webm?t=1788114871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/e021838d321465542b5c478ad63024f8.mp4?t=1788114871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go with friends and watch each others backs, you never know what might want to hurt you or take your friend...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUNKER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/bef0a9ec8d8600a718c4c6d9ae7bdd70.poster.avif?t=1788114871\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/bef0a9ec8d8600a718c4c6d9ae7bdd70.webm?t=1788114871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/bef0a9ec8d8600a718c4c6d9ae7bdd70.mp4?t=1788114871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build out your bunker, use explosive charges to clear out more room, build rooms, walls, floors, storage, tooling, workbenches, gardens, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/f1a816ff6ed257cfd0bc76873a28e32c.poster.avif?t=1788114871\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/f1a816ff6ed257cfd0bc76873a28e32c.webm?t=1788114871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/f1a816ff6ed257cfd0bc76873a28e32c.mp4?t=1788114871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use electricity to build lights, switches, power workbenches, cold storage, and other utility items to personalize your base.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/c2ece731da6ca18526942ac0b79a1276.poster.avif?t=1788114871\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/c2ece731da6ca18526942ac0b79a1276.webm?t=1788114871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/c2ece731da6ca18526942ac0b79a1276.mp4?t=1788114871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not alone in these dense forests and rural towns. You might enter the wrong house and find someone with a machete ready to cut you up, or get snatched, dragged away from your friends and beat. I don't think the military is on your side either...</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corroded is a co-op horror survival game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're safe from the creatures and flooding lands inside the walls of your bunker but you need food and supplies to continue surviving. Do loot runs, get supplies, avoid drowning when the flood comes, build better gear, expand your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FLOODLANDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ever changing uniquely generating floodlands but be careful, you're not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you  explore, grab anything you can gather and return back before the water rises and you risk drowning. Items that don't seem useful could always be recycled and scrapped for raw materials so make sure to load up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/e021838d321465542b5c478ad63024f8.poster.avif?t=1788114871\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/e021838d321465542b5c478ad63024f8.webm?t=1788114871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/e021838d321465542b5c478ad63024f8.mp4?t=1788114871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go with friends and watch each others backs, you never know what might want to hurt you or take your friend...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUNKER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/bef0a9ec8d8600a718c4c6d9ae7bdd70.poster.avif?t=1788114871\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/bef0a9ec8d8600a718c4c6d9ae7bdd70.webm?t=1788114871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/bef0a9ec8d8600a718c4c6d9ae7bdd70.mp4?t=1788114871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build out your bunker, use explosive charges to clear out more room, build rooms, walls, floors, storage, tooling, workbenches, gardens, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/f1a816ff6ed257cfd0bc76873a28e32c.poster.avif?t=1788114871\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/f1a816ff6ed257cfd0bc76873a28e32c.webm?t=1788114871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4325640/extras/f1a816ff6ed257cfd0bc76873a28e32c.mp4?t=1788114871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use electricity to build lights, switches, power workbenches, cold storage, and other utility items to personalize your base.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets